# sys-regi-negative: the ruins' gate says no to a plain Regigigas. In the Iron Ruins
# with Regigigas in the party (the species, without the fateful bit) the seven dots still activate the statue
# but A on it: "from somewhere, something spoke out", no battle (check_party_has_fateful_encounter_regigigas FALSE).
